msgid "SAL Pictogram"
msgstr ""

msgid "Displays the official ANPC SAL pictogram on the homepage, linking to the SAL dispute-resolution platform."
msgstr ""

msgid "Legal Guarantee Notice"
msgstr ""

msgid "Displays the EU-mandated harmonised notice on the legal guarantee of conformity, plus the optional EU GARAN durability label. Required EU-wide from 27 September 2026."
msgstr ""

msgid "Price History"
msgstr ""

msgid "Logs every price change and, next to any sale price, shows the lowest price from the 30 days before the reduction started (Omnibus reference price)."
msgstr ""

msgid "PF/PJ Billing Fields"
msgstr ""

msgid "Individual vs. company checkout billing fields, compatible with the Romanian invoicing-plugin ecosystem."
msgstr ""

msgid "VAT ID Validation"
msgstr ""

msgid "CUI/CIF format and checksum validation at checkout."
msgstr ""

msgid "MAOF"
msgstr ""

msgid "Flags possible related orders and duplicate active orders for staff review."
msgstr ""

msgid "Reviewer Name Privacy"
msgstr ""

msgid "Shows product reviewers on your shop by first name and initials (Ion Popescu becomes Ion P.), leaving the full name out of the page."
msgstr ""

msgid "Compliance Checklist"
msgstr ""

msgid "A guided audit of your shop's legal and trust readiness, with auto-checks and links to fix failing items."
msgstr ""

msgid "SEAP Badge"
msgstr ""

msgid "Displays the SEAP registration badge where required."
msgstr ""

msgid "Counties & Postcodes"
msgstr ""

msgid "Romanian county and postcode base data for checkout address fields."
msgstr ""

msgid "Address Autocomplete"
msgstr ""

msgid "Bidirectional postcode/street autocomplete at checkout, sourced from a RomCommerce-operated Romanian address dataset."
msgstr ""

msgid "Phone Validation"
msgstr ""

msgid "International phone number validation with a country-selector UI at checkout."
msgstr ""

msgid "EU VAT Rates Import"
msgstr ""

msgid "Imports EU member states' VAT rates into WooCommerce's tax tables, for cross-border sales under OSS."
msgstr ""

msgid "Email Verification"
msgstr ""

msgid "Checks whether a checkout email address is deliverable, without blocking submission."
msgstr ""

msgid "Hide Voucher at Checkout"
msgstr ""

msgid "Hides the coupon/voucher field from the checkout page."
msgstr ""

msgid "Coupon Cleanup"
msgstr ""

msgid "Automatically trashes expired coupons daily, with an option to permanently empty the coupon trash after a set number of days."
msgstr ""

msgid "Emergency Delivery Fees"
msgstr ""

msgid "Surcharges for expedited or out-of-schedule delivery."
msgstr ""

msgid "Deposits & Custom Pricing"
msgstr ""

msgid "Partial-payment deposits and custom per-order pricing."
msgstr ""

msgid "Gift Wrap"
msgstr ""

msgid "An add-on gift-wrap option at checkout."
msgstr ""

msgid "Order Confirmation"
msgstr ""

msgid "One-click order confirmation by email and QR code, so customers confirm orders without a phone call."
msgstr ""

msgid "QR Payments / POS"
msgstr ""

msgid "QR codes for in-store, POS-created order confirmation and payment."
msgstr ""

msgid "Courier Nomenclature"
msgstr ""

msgid "Standardised courier/locality naming for shipping labels."
msgstr ""

msgid "Pickup Store Locations"
msgstr ""

msgid "Defines physical pickup locations for orders."
msgstr ""

msgid "Reserve for Pickup"
msgstr ""

msgid "A lightweight reservation flow for customers to hold a product for in-store pickup."
msgstr ""

msgid "Multiple Delivery Addresses"
msgstr ""

msgid "Lets customers save more than one delivery address on their account."
msgstr ""

msgid "Weekly Store Report"
msgstr ""

msgid "A weekly email with your orders by status, average order value, top products and categories, payment methods and order sources, compared with an earlier week."
msgstr ""

msgid "Payment Method Filter"
msgstr ""

msgid "A payment method dropdown on the WooCommerce orders list, next to the date and customer filters."
msgstr ""

msgid "Free Shipping Bar"
msgstr ""

msgid "A progress indicator showing how much more to spend for free shipping."
msgstr ""

msgid "Sale Category Sync"
msgstr ""

msgid "Keeps a \"Sale\" product category in sync with products currently on sale."
msgstr ""

msgid "Recommended Retail Price"
msgstr ""

msgid "Optional manufacturer's recommended retail price (RRP) per product and variation, shown on the product page as a separate labelled line, never crossed out."
msgstr ""

msgid "Related Products"
msgstr ""

msgid "Rule-based control over which related products are shown."
msgstr ""

msgid "Availability Sorting"
msgstr ""

msgid "Moves out-of-stock products to the end of catalog listings, keeping your sort order within each group."
msgstr ""

msgid "Frequently Bought Together"
msgstr ""

msgid "Products you pick shown with each product as a bundle, with the combined price and one button to add them all to the cart."
msgstr ""

msgid "Multi-Product Review Page"
msgstr ""

msgid "Lets a customer review every product from a past order on one page."
msgstr ""

msgid "Reviews Showcase"
msgstr ""

msgid "Recent product reviews from across your store, as a grid on the shop page."
msgstr ""

msgid "Floating contact FAB"
msgstr ""

msgid "A floating multi-channel contact button with contextual WhatsApp deep-links, plus an optional WhatsApp button under Add to Cart."
msgstr ""

msgid "Clear Cart"
msgstr ""

msgid "A one-click \"empty cart\" action."
msgstr ""

msgid "Google Merchant Center Widget"
msgstr ""

msgid "Google's store widget with your Merchant Center store rating, as a badge in a corner of every page."
msgstr ""

msgid "Perks Shop"
msgstr ""

msgid "Trust and service badges near the Add to Cart button, and a payment-methods widget."
msgstr ""

msgid "Admin & Login Branding"
msgstr ""

msgid "Your site logo on the login screen and one brand colour across wp-admin, the login screen, and buttons."
msgstr ""

msgid "Show Some Love"
msgstr ""

msgid "An optional \"Magazin realizat cu RomCommerce\" credit in your site footer. Off unless you switch it on."
msgstr ""

